# Line endings. The repo is developed on Windows but produces Unix artifacts:
# the files below are interpreted as-is by a system that does not tolerate CR.
#
# The critical case is src-tauri/linux/postinst.sh and postrm.sh: they are copied
# into the .deb package's control.tar.gz and run by dpkg. A `#!/bin/sh\r`
# makes the package configuration fail with a message that does not say
# why. Same for the .desktop template, whose every value would carry a
# trailing CR (`Exec=kroki_deskapp %F\r`).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.desktop text eol=lf
